Subject: Review Attention Transition Procedure

& [ProcedureIdentity] is effectless
  + [procedure_id] is attention.review_attention_transition
  + [version] is 0.1.1
  + [purpose] is compare declared before and after attention frames against Cantor identity
  + [authority] is experimental_fixture_only

& [ActivationPattern] is transitional
  + activate when the stimulus supplies an earlier frame and a proposed later frame for review
  + extract both frames without completing or correcting them inside Needle
  + bind purpose to the preserved caller stimulus in the host rather than asking Needle to restate it
  + leave claim-only comparison to inspect_identity_boundary

& [Transform] is bounded
  * retrieve the pinned proof-carrying Cantor definition
  * direct llama.cpp to enumerate preserved, added, removed, conflicting, and unresolved elements
  * keep the transition advisory until separately admitted
  - never: mutate the registered procedure catalogue
  - never: perform an external semantic effect
